Q3 details: Need define f(d). For d≥25 f=d/5+5; for d<25 f=2√d (a=1). D=195. If stop not near ends (25≤x≤170), total=49. Near ends evaluate. Minimum at x=5 or x=190. Compute exact: 43+2√5 = 43+4.47213595=47.4721s. Wait f(190)=190/5+5=38+5=43. yes. Total=43+2√5 ≈47.47s. If stop at 39/F: f(190)=43 + f(5)=2√5 same. Good.

